 # 10\. Structured Output Testing

 One of the most important AI tests is checking the generated structure.

 Expected structure:

```
Comic
 ├── title
 ├── summary
 ├── characters[]
 └── pages[]
      └── panels[]
           ├── sceneDescription
           ├── dialogue[]
           └── caption
```

 Test:

```
Missing title
Invalid pages
Missing panel
Invalid dialogue
Wrong data type
Malformed JSON
```

 The application should reject invalid data rather than rendering unpredictable content.

