 # 25\. Load Testing

 Simulate multiple users performing:

```
Login
 ↓
Create project
 ↓
Generate story
 ↓
Save
```

 Observe:

 - API stability
- Database performance
- Gemini request handling
- Rate-limit behavior
- Server resource usage

