 # 33\. Regression Testing

 Whenever a new feature is added, rerun the existing test suite.

 Example:

```
Add Continue Story
       ↓
Run Continue Story tests
       ↓
Run Editor tests
       ↓
Run Save tests
       ↓
Run Preview tests
       ↓
Run Export tests
```

 This ensures that new AI functionality doesn't break existing comic editing.

