 # 34\. User Acceptance Testing

 UAT should use real-world scenarios.

 ### Scenario

 > Create a 5-page sci-fi comic about a student discovering a robot.

 User should be able to complete:

```
1. Login
2. Create project
3. Enter idea
4. Select Sci-Fi
5. Select comic style
6. Generate
7. Review characters
8. Edit dialogue
9. Regenerate a panel
10. Save
11. Preview
12. Export
```

 The user should be able to complete the workflow without developer assistance.

