 # 36\. Bug Classification

 ### Critical

 Application unusable or serious security/data-loss issue.

 ### High

 Major feature does not work.

 ### Medium

 Feature works incorrectly in certain situations.

 ### Low

 Minor UI or cosmetic issue.

 Example:

```
Bug #021
Severity: High
Feature: Panel regeneration
Problem: Regenerated panel replaces wrong panel
Status: Fixed
Retest: Passed
```

